<title>USA: U.S. Mar factory orders fell 1.6 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Mar factory orders fell 1.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Mar--(Prev)	Feb--(Prev)     Jan</p>
<p> New Orders		 -1.6		  0.4    0.8	2.5</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation     -1.2		  1.5    1.6	2.6</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		-1.4		  0.6    0.9	3.1</p>
<p> NonDurables		-0.3		 -0.4    0.1	0.9</p>
<p> Durables		   -2.6   -3.0	 1.0    0.8	3.8</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	   -4.0   -4.4	 2.4    2.3	4.4</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts    -1.9   -2.6	 7.2    7.2	3.1</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	    -13.7  -16.8     -11.1  -12.4    -23.0</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Mar--(Prev)	Feb--(Prev)     Jan</p>
