<p>Wall Street economists had expected a 1.5 percent drop in total factory orders for March.</p>
<p>The March inventories-to-shipments ratio was 1.38, up from 1.37 in February.</p>
<p>The department reported initial data on March orders for durable goods on April 29.</p>
